Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ew5TyXOlyCpCRptye1LdxA","review_id":"lYPXMjdhPFnB_J3Gl_nINQ","date":"2015-09-01T00:43:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9480844736099243,"text_excerpt":"So usually I live my life pretending to be a foodie. Pretending that I don't enjoy an occasional Mexican Pizza from Taco Bell or a Hot n' Spicy from McDonald's. I've been living a lie. While I do enjoy the finer foods in life I'm also an American that hates/loves chain restaurants. I swore off Pizza Hut awhile ago but tonight it was closer than my other favorites on St. Charles. I ordered the Alex G. Pizza + pineapples and some boneless honey bbq wings. It was so freakin' good. I can't speak on the delivery because I hate paying delivery surcharges so I always pickup my orders. They also have an deal going on now till 9/27. It was any pizza, any toppings, any size or something for $10. Th..."},{"business_id":"ew5TyXOlyCpCRptye1LdxA","review_id":"9m9ENJnSgrD6USq1t3Gvpw","date":"2021-01-01T23:58:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9262616038322449,"text_excerpt":"Order delivery tonight. Best pizza I've had in a long time! It was hot, delivered quickly, and super tasty! Usually I order papa johns but this might of changed my mind for next time!"},{"business_id":"ew5TyXOlyCpCRptye1LdxA","review_id":"d-pLA8b4MG0O32i77QYnig","date":"2013-12-27T02:26:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9213049411773682,"text_excerpt":"What can I say I love Pizza hut! This is by far one of the best chain pizza restaurants around. This pizza hut like all the others in the New Orleans metro area are delivery/take out only. For some reason New Orleans Pizza Huts don't have the sit down restaurants with the pizza buffet and the salad bar. Oh well, at least they still have the same good pizza though. I see that this particular pizza hut keeps getting hit with suspicious looking reviews. Hmm....... a competitor business may be at work here. In short not the best pizza around but still way better than Papa Johns,Little Ceasers,or Original Italian Pie."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ew5TyXOlyCpCRptye1LdxA","photo_id":"5cahK2nIAN5gbGdhEC1pug","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/5cahK2nIAN5gbGdhEC1pug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9191939830780029},{"business_id":"ew5TyXOlyCpCRptye1LdxA","photo_id":"KTbfsN1BkmEod_bteDDEig","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/KTbfsN1BkmEod_bteDDEig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8890810012817383},{"business_id":"ew5TyXOlyCpCRptye1LdxA","photo_id":"yZ1r8Uav_c_gfEODaR4ujQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/yZ1r8Uav_c_gfEODaR4ujQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8603372573852539}]},"notebook_case":null}
